WEBVTT

00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:08.893
You can travel <b>safely</b> on public transportation.

00:00:11.209 --> 00:00:13.951
Her children always speak <b>politely</b>.

00:00:16.255 --> 00:00:18.269
She eats very <b>quickly</b>.

00:00:22.268 --> 00:00:23.434
I work <b>hard</b>.

00:00:25.753 --> 00:00:27.313
We speak English <b>well</b>.